  "description": "Plugin for GitExtensions that automatically generates commit messages in Conventional Commits v1.0.0 format (feat/fix/docs/test/chore/build/refactor), in Brazilian Portuguese or English — selected automatically from the operating system language, with a manual override in the plugin settings — by analyzing the actual content of staged changes. Supports two strategies: comment-based (extracts meaningful comments added to the diff) and filename-based (derives semantic concepts from file names). The message is refreshed automatically whenever files are staged or unstaged while the commit dialog is open.",
